{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉穎鏇（Tiffany）近日於社交平台分享了一段近鏡自拍短片，大放電眼及甜美笑容，並向粉絲展示其精緻的閃粉眼妝，成功吸引不少網民關注及點讚。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從片中所見，劉穎鏇身穿粉紅色上衣，留著一頭浪漫的長捲髮。影片的焦點落在她眼頭及眼皮上的亮粉妝容細節，她對著鏡頭展露招牌的燦爛笑容，期間更特意將臉龐湊近鏡頭，配合眨眼與各種調皮表情，完美呈現出眼妝的閃亮效果。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c7c4cb95-1e26-485d-b9f4-76e830428188.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20266wHJTir59C1786331464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c7c4cb95-1e26-485d-b9f4-76e830428188.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"21a07b43-c33f-4a57-a6d6-6794c0e21dc4.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20269aQleJl3On1786331464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"21a07b43-c33f-4a57-a6d6-6794c0e21dc4.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了大曬靚樣，劉穎鏇亦在帖文中以英文親切留言詢問粉絲：「do you like the glittery eye detail? 🤭✨」（你喜歡這個閃光眼妝細節嗎？）</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:23:59.913878+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}